zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,78,42,39,36,65],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005302","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,78,42,39,36,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005302","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,78,42,39,36,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005302","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020005"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国将领。早年曾随孙策平定江东，在神亭岭之战中，作为孙策的十三骑亲卫之一，见证了孙策与太史慈的单挑对决。215年，随孙权攻合肥，被张辽击败。222年，随大都督陆逊防御刘备，率军连续攻破刘备五座大营，斩杀蜀军将领，直接动摇了蜀汉的前线部署。此役后，他与徐盛、潘璋力主追击刘备至白帝城，但陆逊出于对曹魏的防范而否决。","tc":"吳國將領。早年曾隨孫策平定江東，在神亭嶺之戰中，作為孫策的十三騎親衛之一，見證了孫策與太史慈的單挑對決。215年，隨孫權攻合肥，被張遼擊敗。222年，隨大都督陸遜防御劉備，率軍連續攻破劉備五座大營，斬殺蜀軍將領，直接動搖了蜀漢的前線部署。此役后，他與徐盛、潘璋力主追擊劉備至白帝城，但陸遜出于對曹魏的防范而否決。","en":"General of Wu. In his early years, he followed Sun Ce in pacifying Jiangdong and was one of Sun Ce's thirteen personal riders at the Battle of Shenting Ridge, witnessing the duel between Sun Ce and Taishi Ci. In 215, he accompanied Sun Quan in the attack on Hefei but was defeated by Zhang Liao. In 222, serving under Minister Lu Xun to defend against Liu Bei, he led forces that broke through five of Liu Bei's camps in succession, killing Shu generals and directly destabilizing Shu-Han's frontline deployment. After the battle, he urged alongside Xu Sheng and Pan Zhang that they pursue Liu Bei to Baidi Castle, but Lu Xun vetoed it out of caution against Cao Wei.","jp":"呉の武将。若き頃は孫策に従って江東の平定にあたり、神亭嶺の戦いでは孫策の十三騎の親衛のひとりとして、孫策と太史慈の一騎討ちを見届けた。215年、孫権に従って合肥を攻めるも張遼に敗れた。222年、大都督の陸遜に従って劉備に対する防御にあたり、軍を率いて劉備の陣営を立て続けに五つ破り、蜀軍の武将を討ち取って蜀漢の前線配置を大きく揺るがした。この戦いの後、徐盛や潘璋とともに劉備を白帝城まで追撃することを強く主張したが、曹魏を警戒する陸遜によって退けられた。","kr":"오나라의 장수. 젊은 시절 손책을 따라 강동을 평정했으며, 신정령 전투에서는 손책을 호위한 13기 중 한 명으로서 손책과 태사자의 일기토를 지켜보았다. 215년에는 손권을 따라 합비를 공격했으나 장료에게 패했다. 222년, 대도독 육손을 따라 유비에 맞서 방어에 나섰을 때 군사를 이끌고 유비의 영채 다섯 곳을 연달아 격파하고 촉군 장수를 참수하여 촉한의 전방 배치를 크게 흔들어 놓았다. 이 전투가 끝난 뒤 서성, 반장과 함께 유비를 백제성까지 추격하자고 강력히 주장했으나, 조위를 경계한 육손에 의해 저지되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10383","remark":"","surname":"宋","surnameTc":"宋","surnameEn":"Song","surnameJp":"宋","surnameKr":"송","surnameOther":"","name":"谦","nameTc":"謙","nameEn":"Qian","nameJp":"謙","nameKr":"겸","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"宋谦","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"194","city":"CS1025","gender":"0","rule":"73","force":"78","wise":"42","politics":"39","charm":"36","will":"65","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"2","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"23/74/23/23/23/10/50/23","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1003402","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1005705","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4300","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"1700","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000905","professions":"3/0/1/0/2/2/1/0/0/0/1/2/1/0/2/0/0/0/0/1/0/2/2/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"82","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2600","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"175","show":"194","death":"227","age":"0","injury":"","deathR